<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon receipt of an energy audit report from the energy consumer under subsection (2), the Commission may request the energy consumer to give any additional information, particulars or document relating to the energy audit report as the Commission thinks necessary and if the energy consumer fails to give such additional information, particulars or document, the energy audit report may be refused by the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
