<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Commission directs the energy consumer to rectify the energy audit report under subsection (7) and the energy consumer fails to rectify the energy audit report as directed by the Commission, the Commission shall further direct the energy consumer to submit a new energy audit report within the period as may be determined by the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
