<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_14__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A registered energy auditor appointed by a person in charge of a building to which this Act applies under subsection 13(6) shall prepare an energy audit report based on the energy audit conducted under subsection 13(7) in accordance with the guidelines."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_14__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
