<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_14__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Commission directs the person in charge of the building to rectify the energy audit report under subsection (4) and the person in charge of the building fails to rectify the energy audit report as directed by the Commission, the Commission shall further direct the person in charge of the building to submit a new energy audit report within the period as may be determined by the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
