<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The person in charge of the building shall submit the energy efficiency improvement plan prepared under subsection (1) to the Commission for the Commission’s approval together with the energy audit report under subsection 14(2)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
