<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "After considering the energy efficiency improvement plan, the Commission may approve or refuse the energy efficiency improvement plan."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
