<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Commission refuses the energy efficiency improvement plan, the Commission shall direct the person in charge of the building to revise the energy efficiency improvement plan within the period and in such manner as may be determined by the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
