<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IX__cl_43__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An authorized officer shall have all the powers necessary to carry out an investigation in relation to the commission of an offence under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IX__cl_43__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IX__cl_43> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
