<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IX__cl_44__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "to enter any premises other than premises used only for residential;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
