<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IX__cl_44__para_e> <https://schema.org/text> "to require, but only if and to the extent that it is reasonably necessary in order to secure that the provisions of this Act and of any order or directions made under this Act are duly observed, any person having authority to do so to break open any container or open any vending machine, and if that person does not comply with the requirement, the authorized officer may do so himself. Search and seizure with warrant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
