<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "refuses to give any authorized officer access to any premises which the authorized officer is entitled to have under this Act or in the execution of any duty imposed or power conferred by this Act;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
