<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__para_e> <https://schema.org/text> "gives information or documents that he knows or has reason to believe is false or misleading, in response to a direction issued by the Commission, commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both. Evidence of agent provocateur admissible"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
