<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_38__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who fails to comply with the direction of the Commission under subsection (1) shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_38__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_38> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
