<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_23__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon cancellation of the certificate of energy efficiency, the certificate of energy efficiency shall cease to be valid from the date of the written notice issued by the Commission under subsection (1) and the registered manufacturer or registered importer shall recall and cause to be removed from the market the energy-using product in respect of which the cancelled certificate of energy efficiency has been issued within the period as specified in the written notice."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
