<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_X__cl_62> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any person who commits an offence under this Act is a company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons, a person who at the time of the commission of the offence was a director, compliance officer, partner, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons or was purporting to act in the capacity or was in any manner or to any extent responsible for the management of any of the affairs of the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons or was assisting in its management—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_X__cl_62__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_X__cl_62> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
