<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_X__cl_62__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "may be charged severally or jointly in the same proceedings with the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or the body of persons; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_X__cl_62__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_X__cl_62__para_b__subpara_i> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
