<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@/~part_X__cl_62__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "if the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons is found guilty of the offence, shall be deemed to be guilty of that offence and shall be liable to the same punishment or penalty as an individual unless, having regard to the nature of his functions in that capacity and to all circumstances, he proves—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/28/eng@> .
